date-released: "2026-09-15"
abstract: >-
  A latency-audited, non-anticipative replay benchmark that measures whether the
  decision-relevant weather-sensitive construction window is resolvable from
  archived as-issued NOAA GFS surface-gust forecasts paired with KNMI station
  observations (2021-2025). The package fits decision-aligned block-window
  calibrators, reports Brier skill and relative economic value, and runs a lift
  campaign comparing blind, raw-threshold, climatology and calibrated rules.
